mental role governance, real-time OCC)Tj T* 2.8368 Tw (synchronization, and AI-driven venue photo-to-stage synthesis into a cohesive)Tj T* 0 Tw (production pipeline. StageSync specifically bridges this critical gap.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 313 356.5 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 10.8 TL/F3 8.9 Tf 1 0 0 1 31.23385 1.9 Tm (III. PROPOSED SYSTEM AND ARCHITECTURE)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 313 327.2 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 2.75605 Tw 9.1 TL/F2 7.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 19.7 Tm (StageSync addresses this operational fragmentation through a robust multi-tier)Tj T* .7259 Tw (cloud-native architecture, decoupling computationally intensive 3D rendering in the)Tj T* 0 Tw (browser from distributed transactional persistence in the cloud.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 313 252.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT .892036 Tw 9.1 TL/F2 7.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 65.2 Tm (To satisfy the rigorous operational demands of live event crews, StageSync fulfills)Tj T* 4.084571 Tw (four foundational architectural requirements: \(1\) )Tj/F4 7.6 Tf (Zero-Client Footprint:)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( Full)Tj T* 1.9666 Tw (execution inside standard web browsers via WebGL/WebGPU without requiring)Tj T* 3.271371 Tw (native software installation. \(2\) )Tj/F4 7.6 Tf (Sub-50ms State Synchronization:)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( Low-latency)Tj T* .8304 Tw (WebSocket broadcasting ensuring immediate visual parity across distributed teams.)Tj T* 1.0698 Tw (\(3\) )Tj/F4 7.6 Tf (Granular Role Governance:)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( Strict departmental security boundaries preventing)Tj T* 3.029257 Tw (unauthorized scene mutations. \(4\) )Tj/F4 7.6 Tf (ACID Transactional Persistence:)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( Relational)Tj T* 0 Tw (durability guaranteeing absolute project auditability and production sign-off integrity.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 313 214 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 1.217455 Tw 9.1 TL/F2 7.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 28.8 Tm (By separating the computational demands of 60 FPS viewport rendering from the)Tj T* 1.607067 Tw (authoritative state consensus mechanisms, the architecture ensures that clients on)Tj T* .781 Tw (constrained hardware \(e.g., backstage