h Supabase)Tj T* .999067 Tw (managed services, providing ACID compliance for production records and durable)Tj T* 0 Tw (S3-compatible object storage for 3D glTF/GLB assets [10].)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 38 331.7 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 9.8 TL/F6 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 1.6 Tm (B. High-Performance WebGL/WebGPU 3D Rendering Pipeline)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 38 221.3 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 2.638655 Tw 9.1 TL/F2 7.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 101.6 Tm (The visual planner is engineered using Three.js and R3F [9]. R3F reconciles)Tj T* .56172 Tw (declarative React component trees directly into the imperative Three.js scene graph.)Tj T* -.0449 Tw (Every stage element \(riser, truss, lighting instrument, audio stack\) is instantiated as an)Tj T* .863956 Tw (isolated declarative component with associated transformation matrices )Tj/F3 7.6 Tf (T)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( )Tj/F7 7.6 Tf <ce>Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( SE\(3\).)Tj T* .99872 Tw (To maintain fluid 60 FPS viewport navigation during complex multi-asset staging,)Tj T* .364889 Tw (the rendering pipeline employs three performance optimizations: \(1\) )Tj/F4 7.6 Tf (Instanced Mesh)Tj T* 1.158667 Tw (Rendering:)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( Modular truss segments and identical lighting instruments share single)Tj T* .416 Tw (GPU draw calls via `InstancedMesh`, reducing draw-call overhead by over 80%. \(2\))Tj T* 4.3416 Tw/F4 7.6 Tf (Frustum and Occlusion Culling:)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf ( Off-screen and obstructed geometries are)Tj T* 1.46688 Tw (dynamically culled before GPU submission. \(3\) )Tj/F4 7.6 Tf (Dynamic Level of Detail \(LOD\):)Tj/F2 7.6 Tf T* 5.12725 Tw (High-poly glTF prop assets seamlessly transition to simplified bounding)Tj T* 0 Tw (representations during rapid orbit camera rotations.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 38 192 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 1.842667 Tw 9.1 TL/F2 7.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 19.7 Tm (In addition, StageSync implements efficient WebGL vertex buffer recycling and)Tj T* .901956 Tw (texture atlas sharing, avoiding garbage collection spikes during continuous runtime)Tj T* 0 Tw (transform manipulation.)Tj T* ET Q q